; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Blue/Terran command station uses the retail GTI Arcadia as-is, which has no
; $Collision Physics: override and so defaults to FSO's stock 5.0m instant
; push-away plus rotational kick on every collision -- confirmed live as the
; station "spinning" and ships "bumping" into it. Per code/ship.cpp, this
; field is parsed right after $Show damage: and before $Density:. Death-roll
; rotation is configured separately below; retain other retail stats.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$Name: GTI Arcadia
+nocreate
$Collision Physics:
    +Bounce: 0.0
    +Both Small Bounce: 0.0
    +Rotation Factor: 0.0
    +Rotation Magnitude Maximum: 0.0
$Death Roll X rotation Cap: 0.0
$Death Roll Y rotation Cap: 0.0
$Death Roll Z rotation Cap: 0.0
$Armor Type: RTS Command Hull
$Shield Armor Type: RTS Command Hull
; +nocreate can retype a subsystem in place: the parser matches the name against
; the inherited list case-insensitively, so turret01..turret06 are the real
; install01.pof mounts and keep their own hull positions. The retail list only
; carries Terran Turret / FighterKiller banks, so Blue had no guaranteed beam
; battery like Red and Gold. Dedicated station variants limit both acquisition
; and active ray length to 6 km. RTS:EnableFullArsenal frees them at runtime.
$Subsystem: turret01, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station AAAf" "RTS Sentry Interceptor" )
$Subsystem: turret02, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station AAAf" "RTS Sentry Interceptor" )
$Subsystem: turret03, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station LTerSlash" )
$Subsystem: turret04, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station LTerSlash" )
$Subsystem: turret05, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station LTerSlash" )
$Subsystem: turret06, 1, 2.0
    $Default PBanks: ( "RTS Station LTerSlash" )

; The retail Belial POF has three detail levels, despite four in ships.tbl.
; This platform is now spawnable through the station defenses panel.
$Name: SSG Belial
+nocreate
$Detail distance: (0, 100, 800)

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Capital beams carry $Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam, and RTS Base Hull scales
; that type to 10% for capital ships. Command stations use RTS Command Hull at
; 25%, so a newly built Sathanas or Colossus cannot delete one in a single volley.
; Zeroed collision physics matches the station entries so a huge hull that clips
; a base does not roll away from its own attack run.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$Name: GTCv Deimos
+nocreate
$Collision Physics:
    +Bounce: 0.0
    +Both Small Bounce: 0.0
    +Rotation Factor: 0.0
    +Rotation Magnitude Maximum: 0.0
$Armor Type: RTS Base Hull
$Shield Armor Type: RTS Base Hull
